00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They knew that
I liked the show.

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:25.358
They knew it was a big deal fo
me when I got hired as a writer.

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:27.660 line:92%
But then, they asked me --

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
