00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:34.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or something.
They don't know that it's here

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:37.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So they didn't know the first
detail about the show.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:37.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Exactly.
-Yeah.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Truly the first piece of
information that's given out

00:05:40.073 --> 00:05:42.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
