York, and they didn't know

00:05:42.675 --> 00:05:44.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Have they been able to come
and see it?

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They have.
They came a couple times.

00:05:45.845 --> 00:05:47.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
They came last year
for my birthday

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
during Liev Schreiber's show
-Oh, that's good.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And they really
liked Lil Wayne.

00:05:52.785 --> 00:05:54.387 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.387 --> 00:05:56.923 align:start size:94% position:6%
My dad was like,
"He's really good.

00:05:56.923 --> 00:05:58.825 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.825 --> 00:06:00.593 line:92%
He's got bars." And then -

00:06:00.593 --> 00:06:02.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then they came
for the premiere this season

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:04.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
too, which was so great.
-Oh, that's great.

00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:05.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Hey, I'm so happy

00:06:05.298 --> 00:06:07.834
you're on the show, and I'm so
happy to have you here today

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:09.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just absolutely fantastic
talking to you.

00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:10.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks so much, Seth.
This is so great.

00:06:10.603 --> 00:06:12.271 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Bowen Yang, everybody.

